style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">63.</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:95%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none"><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:9.55pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Экология ва иқлим ўзгариши миллий қўмитаси ҳузуридаги Гидрометеорология хизмати агентлиги</span></span></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:3%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:1px solid black"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">64.</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:95%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none"><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:9.55pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Экология ва иқлим ўзгариши миллий қўмитаси ҳузуридаги Чиқиндиларни бошқариш ва циркуляр иқтисодиётни ривожлантириш агентлиги</span></span></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td style="border-bottom:none;width:3%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:none;border-left:none"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"></p></td><td style="border-bottom:none;width:95%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:none;border-left:none"><p align="right" style="text-align:right;text-indent:9.55pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">»</span></span><span style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">;</span></span></span></span></span></p></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div><div class="ACT_TEXT"><div name="8104560" id="8104560">(б) в <a href="https://lex.uz/docs/7587464?ONDATE=23.06.2025 00#7591760">приложении № 8</a>:</div></div><div class="ACT_TEXT"><div name="8104561" id="8104561">(i) <a href="https://lex.uz/docs/7587464?ONDATE=23.06.2025 00#7591900">приложение № 1</a> дополнить графой следующего содержания:</div></div><div class="TABLE_STD2"><div name="8104575" id="8104575"><table class="Table" style="width:100.0%;border-collapse:collapse;border:none" width="100%"><tbody><tr><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:100%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:none;border-left:none" valign="top"><p><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:107%"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif">«</span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:100%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:1px solid black" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:107%"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="color:black">Экология ва иқлим ўзгариши органларининг махсус унвонлари</span></b></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:100%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:1px solid black" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times N